Package: HLCtools
Title: Herd Lying Concordance
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Guilherme", "Amorim Franchi", , "gaf@anivet.au.dk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for calculating Herd Lying Concordance metrics from individual animal lying behaviour data. The package supports multiple dispersion bases, threshold synchrony comparisons, and lying-weighted HLC metrics.
